# Keep build context small — only the site itself is needed in the image.
.git
.idea
*.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker/*
!docker/nginx-default.conf
!docker/ssl
# `media/` IS baked into the image (Dockerfile: COPY media ...).
# It is gitignored; restore it from the motionbank-media.tar archive
# (see root README "Media self-hosting") before `docker build`.
